[27.220993, "o", "\u001b[?25h"]
[28.010976, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[22mThe following \u001b[33mwarnings\u001b[39m were returned during `modify_header()`:\r\n"]
[28.024203, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[22m\u001b[33m!\u001b[39m For variable `age` (`stage_group`) and \u001b[34m\"estimate\"\u001b[39m, \u001b[34m\"statistic\"\u001b[39m, \u001b[34m\"p.value\"\u001b[39m, \u001b[34m\"conf.low\"\u001b[39m, and\r\n  \u001b[34m\"conf.high\"\u001b[39m statistics: \u001b[33mcannot compute exact p-value with ties\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[28.034505, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[22m\u001b[33m!\u001b[39m For variable `age` (`stage_group`) and \u001b[34m\"estimate\"\u001b[39m, \u001b[34m\"statistic\"\u001b[39m, \u001b[34m\"p.value\"\u001b[39m, \u001b[34m\"conf.low\"\u001b[39m, and\r\n  \u001b[34m\"conf.high\"\u001b[39m statistics: \u001b[33mcannot compute exact confidence intervals with ties\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[28.108591, "o", "\u001b[?25h"]
